# ===============================================================
# Deliberately NOT ignored: do not add these
# ===============================================================
# Migrations/                → EF migrations are source code; MigrateAsync()
#                              on startup needs them to build the database.
# package-lock.json          → locks exact frontend dependency versions.
# *.sln / *.slnx / *.csproj  → the project/solution files themselves.
# Properties/launchSettings.json → shared run profiles (keep secrets out of it).
# global.json                → pins the .NET 10 SDK version for the team.
# Directory.Build.props / Directory.Packages.props → shared build config.
# .env.development / .env.production → non-secret frontend config (e.g. API URL).
